{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088390/extras/0c35290d0e88ca04ea8e45622ac93f66.avif?t=1762387262\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088390/extras_big/0c35290d0e88ca04ea8e45622ac93f66.webp?t=1762387262 width=1560 height=439 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hamstory</strong> is a <strong>2D pixel jump platformer game</strong> where you can experience both emotion and challenge simultaneously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players embark on a journey with 'Hamcho' toward Haessi Star,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >gathering strength to leap, sometimes falling, and experiencing the process of rising again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Falling is not failure, but part of growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat with warm animal friends, listen to their stories,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and discover the true 'meaning of challenge.'</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump Toward the Next!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold down the jump button to gather strength, then time it right to leap far.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One small mistake can lead to a big fall, but that's okay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The instincts you learn from falling will lead you to higher places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088390/extras/2a62024c0c982ef41b463511012b532a.poster.avif?t=1762387262\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088390/extras/2a62024c0c982ef41b463511012b532a.webm?t=1762387262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088390/extras/2a62024c0c982ef41b463511012b532a.mp4?t=1762387262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Journey with Animal Residents</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's okay to fall. The warm comfort of the residents awaits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn new jump techniques by fulfilling their requests,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and discover the stories hidden within each of their tales.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional Pixel Graphics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With full pixel art and delicate animations created directly with a mouse,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >we've expressed a world where small creatures come to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088390/extras/927e7ae4630bacd8c7708a18eabe6c98.poster.avif?t=1762387262\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088390/extras/927e7ae4630bacd8c7708a18eabe6c98.webm?t=1762387262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088390/extras/927e7ae4630bacd8c7708a18eabe6c98.mp4?t=1762387262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>We Support Your Challenge!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear the &quot;Beginning of Spring&quot; stage and complete the demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own story by repeating falls and leaps.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4088390?t=1762387262","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4088390?t=1762387262","capsule_image":"https://