n to gather strength, then time it right to leap far.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One small mistake can lead to a big fall, but that's okay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The instincts you learn from falling will lead you to higher places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088390/extras/2a62024c0c982ef41b463511012b532a.poster.avif?t=1762387262\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088390/extras/2a62024c0c982ef41b463511012b532a.webm?t=1762387262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088390/extras/2a62024c0c982ef41b463511012b532a.mp4?t=1762387262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Journey with Animal Residents</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's okay to fall. The warm comfort of the residents awaits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn new jump techniques by fulfilling their requests,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and discover the stories hidden within each of their tales.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional Pixel Graphics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With full pixel art and delicate animations created directly with a mouse,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >we've expressed a world where small creatures come to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088390/extras/927e7ae4630bacd8c7708a18eabe6c98.poster.avif?t=1762387262\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088390/extras/927e7ae4630bacd8c7708a18eabe6c98.webm?t=17623